    "title_en": "Constraints on Galactic Dark Photons from a DALI Prototype",
    "abstract_en": "An analysis of 36 hours of data from a DALI haloscope reveals no statistically significant excess attributable to dark-photon dark matter. We therefore set new constraints in the 6.88691--6.91792 GHz band, reaching a dark-photon-to-photon kinetic mixing strength of $χ\\lesssim 6.8\\times10^{-14}$ at $28.54 \\, μ\\mathrm{eV}$. To our knowledge, this result established the strongest laboratory-based exclusion limit in this frequency range.",
